{"articles":[{"no":"第一條","path":[],"text":"本標準依都市更新條例(以下簡稱本條例)第六十五條第四項規定\n\n       訂定之。","id":"嘉義市-GL000779/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"6ad55d4aff612457243932af207d105f3e1c3c8d941a0b63b6070d61089230ed","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第二條","path":[],"text":"本標準之主管機關為嘉義市政府。","id":"嘉義市-GL000779/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"f47959291fbe5631fce1156499bde769aa1dff8e62971b298ef73703df8d1f9e","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第三條","path":[],"text":"本標準適用範圍為依本條例第七條、第八條劃定或變更之迅行及\n\n       策略性更新地區。","id":"嘉義市-GL000779/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"9f15d32d94e7961452f6f882a934d36575b6c7bb4529e00e60d75945adab5842","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第四條","path":[],"text":"更新單元放寬建蔽率，土地使用分區以住宅區為限，且不得超過\n\n       原建蔽率。","id":"嘉義市-GL000779/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"68870dd1ae268636434dbdae35ef919504974004c94d6062447f9a8c9bf1a4dd","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第五條","path":[],"text":"更新單元之建築物高度，除飛航安全管制及軍事管制外，不受建\n\n       築法令及都市計畫法令之建築高度限制。","id":"嘉義市-GL000779/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"f4bcd240dd437f7642be05af59aedb176d5d51d4fa8e7e9384a5e8f194ae3ed2","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第六條","path":[],"text":"本標準自發布日施行。","id":"嘉義市-GL000779/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"0760487a7e1a3f98a433704c163a939df3ca09942ff350f224457b344857930a","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"",